    [   0] m "I think the most important skill in life is being able to fake confidence."
    [   1] m "I'm pretty convinced that everyone feels at least a little bit scared and alone."
    [   2] m "But being able to trick others into thinking you have it all together..."
    [   3] m "That's a key part of getting people to respect and admire you."
    [   4] m "I think I got pretty good at that over the years."
    [   5] m "I don't show my weaknesses very often."
    [   6] m "But because of that, I haven't had many people I could really open up to..."
    [   7] m "I mean, when do you reach the point in a friendship where you can start expressing your vulnerabilities?"
    [   8] m "Anyway...that's one reason I'm so glad I have you now."
    [   9] m "I feel like I'm a little bit less scared and alone, when you're here with me."
    [  10] m "Do you feel the same way?"
    [  11] m "I really want to be that person for you."
